  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 6 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}6 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot (-3)-0\\cdot 0)i-(6\\cdot (-3)-0\\cdot 5)j+(6\\cdot 0-(-2)\\cdot 5)k \\\\  & =(6-0)i-(-18-0)j+(0-(-10))k \\\\  & =6i+18j+10k \\\\  & =\u27e86,18,10\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
